 "description": "<p>A witch costume in patent leather: hand sleeves and dress in purple, with a bust range of 68-74 cm and waist of 66-100 cm, one size for 40-60 kg. The mandala print sets it apart from the black-hat default of the genre.</p>\n<p>Purple patent leather is a rare colorway in costume construction - most witch listings run black fabric. The hand sleeves extend the design past the wrists, which is where the print shows in photographs.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather</li>\n<li>Includes: hand sleeves, dress</li>\n<li>Style: witch, mandala</li>\n<li>Color: purple</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, bust 68-74 cm, waist 66-100 cm, 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The 68-74 cm bust range is narrow for patent leather - measure before ordering. Halloween-ready in a color most competitors skip.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Purple mandala witch set in patent leather with hand sleeves and dress, bust 68-74 cm, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
